Download

 Click {{{https://github.com/tntim96/FakeSMTP/releases/download/v2.1.2/fakeSMTP-2.1.2.jar}here}} to download the latest version (2.1.2).

 Since version 2.0 you cannot restart the SMTP server within the app (closing the app will stop the server).\
 It is recommended to use the latest version, as it fixes various issues.\


* Get the sources

 Source code available on {{{http://github.com/tntim96/FakeSMTP}GitHub}}.

